  "title": "Lazy-Sunday Thai Roasted Meat Larb",
  "description": "A slow-cooked, comforting Thai dish featuring the rich flavors of tamarind paste, perfect for a lazy Sunday meal. Roasted meats are combined with crunchy vegetables and fragrant herbs, served with steamed jasmine rice.",
